# Audit Documentation Sync

- For every meaningful refactor/fix, update `docs/audit/06-progress-tracker.md`.
- If risk/security impact exists, also update `docs/audit/03-security-risks-register.md`.
- Keep entries short and factual:
  - scope
  - files changed
  - findings
  - mitigation/result
  - manual verification
- Do not postpone docs updates to the end of a long session; update per completed task slice.
- Keep `AGENTS.md` aligned when project-wide conventions or runtime facts change.
